            "review_text": "Lee_N_76\nEindhoven, The Netherlands309 contributions\n0\nNot good value\nOct 2017 • Friends\nThis is a franchise chain restaurant and e ate at Hotto Lotte Mart in Tay Son. Nothing in this shopping centre is good value and this place is no exception. The waiter greeted and took order as soon as we walked in but they took a pretty long time (about 20-30 minutes I reckon) to bring the foods out, considering that we ordered burgers. The size wasn't big and they forgot to bring our drinks until we reminded them\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 26, 2017",
